    "sentence_translations": [
      "Top Student Dog",
      "",
      "At Wuhan University there is a very famous dog.",
      "She is very smart.",
      "She can ride the public bus to come attend class at the university.",
      "She likes to attend class together with her classmates, and also likes to run together with them.",
      "All the fellow students at Wuhan University like her, and call her \"Top Student Dog\".",
      "Some say that if even a dog loves studying that much, we really should study well.",
      "Others say, if a dog can even \"attend\" a key university, we are really inferior even to dogs."
